  "description": "<p data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"530\">Herbeleef drie iconische Mario-avonturen in één prachtige collectie met <strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"347\">Super Mario 3D All-Stars</strong>. Deze bundel bevat <em data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"383\">Super Mario 64</em>, <em data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"407\">Super Mario Sunshine</em> en <em data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"431\">Super Mario Galaxy</em>, allemaal geoptimaliseerd voor de Nintendo Switch met verbeterde resolutie en soepelere besturing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"651\">Het exemplaar verkeert <strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"573\">In Nette Staat</strong>, is volledig getest en 100% functioneel.<br data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"617\">Standaard <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"650\">met doosje geleverd</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"670\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<li data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"721\">\r\n<p data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"721\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"705\">3 klassieke 3D-Mario games</strong> in één pakket</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"769\">🎮 Verbeterde resolutie & moderne besturing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"838\">🌍 Volledige nostalgie gecombineerd met frisse, moderne gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"901\">\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"901\">🚀 Perfect voor zowel nieuwe spelers als retro-liefhebbers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"957\">🎵 Inclusief muziekplayer met iconische soundtracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"981\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\n<li data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1021\"><strong data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"994\">Titel:</strong> Super Mario 3D All-Stars</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1055\"><strong data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1037\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1085\"><strong data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1068\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1120\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1120\"><strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1098\">Genre:</strong> Platform / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1146\"><strong data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1144\">Games inbegrepen:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1167\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1167\">Super Mario 64</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1194\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1194\">Super Mario Sunshine</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1219\">Super Mario Galaxy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1238\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1238\"><strong data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1234\">Spelers:</strong> 1</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1267\"><strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1254\">Geleverd:</strong> Met doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1302\"><strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1292\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
